# jaaOS — Server profile EXTRAS (installed on top of minimal.packages).
# Starter set; the hosting CLI (Phase 4) and monitoring stack (Phase 5) expand this.

# Rootless containers (default runtime)
podman
uidmap
slirp4netns
catatonit
fuse-overlayfs

# --- Monitoring (Phase 5) ---
# From Debian main (inherits Debian security maintenance — CLAUDE.md policy):
prometheus-node-exporter
prometheus
prometheus-alertmanager
auditd
aide
aide-common
#
# "full" mode adds Grafana + Loki + Alloy + Falco. These are NOT in Debian main; they come from
# the vendors' own signed APT repos, added via the jaaOS overlay (see
# docs/06-phase5-monitoring.md §Install). Listed here as a reminder, commented so this profile
# stays installable from Debian alone:
#   grafana            # grafana.com apt repo
#   loki               # grafana.com apt repo
#   alloy              # grafana.com apt repo (replaces promtail)
#   falco              # falcosecurity apt repo; MUST use the modern_ebpf driver on our
#                      # Secure Boot + lockdown + module.sig_enforce kernel (no out-of-tree kmod)

# Handy on a server
curl
rsync
ca-certificates
